 "level_notes": {
  "1": "The syntax reference (doc/syntax.md in jgm/djot) is the only definition; there is no formal spec yet. Its rendered HTML is served through htmlpreview, which builds the page client-side, so no section anchors are linked.",
  "0": "djot.js is the reference implementation; its test/*.test files double as the conformance suite. djot.lua (original), jotdown (Rust) and Pandoc's reader are independent implementations."
 },
